WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,750
Otherwise this is the case

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:02,800
The prices we offer here are indeed not high.

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,200
We'll give you another 300 yuan discount

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,800
I'll take away the trash you don't want here.

5
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,900
At that time, we paid 300 yuan. What do you think, young man?

6
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,800
Then I'll pay you fifteen hundred dollars as you said.

7
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,100
You help me smash down this wall inside

8
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,400
Clean up all the rubbish

9
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,800
Including the garbage I wanted to throw away before

10
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,400
You have to throw it down for me, that's what Auntie decided.

11
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,600
This matter is left to the two of us.

12
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,700
You don't have to worry about it. Just give us the key.

13
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,600
Just leave it to us

14
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,400
Hey, ok, ok, auntie

15
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,100
Where is the junk you don’t want?

16
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,500
Everything here is unnecessary

17
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,800
Clean it all up for me

18
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:32,300
There are so many unnecessary clothes. It’s good. Just wait. You don’t have to worry about it. Okay. Okay.

19
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,800
Then I'll go and get busy first, Brother Xiao

20
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:39,830
Then I'll take care of you first and smash the wall. The magician is awesome, Brother Xiao.

21
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:42,630
You are too fierce, Brother Xiao

22
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:43,930
What a beautiful job you did

23
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:45,030
After we had dinner

24
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:52,920
Just move these things down later. Auntie, we can come up for inspection after we finish them.

25
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,160
I'll do it right away

26
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:56,860
You guys do things so fast, auntie

27
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:58,660
It’s all because of me, Brother Xiao, that I’m so good at what I do without him.

28
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:00,660
How could I possibly do this, boy?

29
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:02,360
Your body looks unusual

30
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:03,660
I didn't expect it to be so powerful

31
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:04,760
Thank you very much
